From aa961bc763c6bbd7ab1b66eb4aa9225e2b267d4d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 19:46:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix new-folder closing the picker; folder picker for library
 folders; RSS JSON editor

- Folder chooser: creating a folder (or pressing Enter in it) no longer
  submits the form it was opened from. The dialog is portalled, but React
  bubbles submit/keydown through the component tree, so the rule editor
  saved and re-mounted (and the chooser vanished) mid-browse.
- Settings > Library folders: "Add folder" opens the folder chooser and
  appends the pick; the list stays editable, one folder per line.
- RSS > Edit as JSON: all feeds and rules as one document (rules reference
  feeds by URL, optional id allows renames). GET/PUT /api/rss/config;
  validated up front and written in one transaction, never re-matches
  existing articles, optional delete-missing with a count and confirm.
  Errors show line/column and jump to the spot; Tab indents, Ctrl/Cmd+S
  saves, Format, Download and Undo changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013nmSf2zmYoNEfzcNutPGUX
